% TR-059 (Hattori, Yokoi, "The Concepts and Facilities of SIMPOS File System", ICOT TR-059, 84.04)
% PDF page 11, printed folio 9. Section 3.1(1) 'Creating and opening a file' and 3.1(2) 'File buffer'.
% Transcribed by eye from 300dpi code-line crops (work/tr0059/m*.png), F2 2026-11-23. Courier font: punctuation clear.
% Bullet descriptions ('o To ...') are given as % comments; only the indented code lines are printed code.

% o To open a file
             :open(#file,File,File_Name)
% o To create a file
             :create(#file,File,File_Name)
% o To close a file
             :close(File)
% o To remove a file
             :remove(File)
% (2) File buffer
% o To get the record data in a vector/string
             :record_data(Buffer,Record_Data)
% o To get or set the data size        (continued on PDF p12)
